n-Hispanic whites, diabetes prevalence increased with age (p<0.001; t-test for trend)\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Data were weighted to reflect the age, sex, and racial/ethnic distribution of the noninstitutionalized population of those six areas.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"All differences were statistically significant (p<0.05) unless otherwise noted.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}